WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.850
 I think it's enabling patients to take

00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:04.340
 charge of their health.

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:07.190
 So it's that extra push sometimes that

00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:09.120
 really helps when your doctor or care

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:09.660
 provider gives

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:11.260
 you that advice to say, "Hey, we need you

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:12.780
 to make these lifestyle changes."

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:14.900
 Oftentimes patients don't know where to

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:17.100
 go or where to start and Nuna helps

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:17.500
 bridge that

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:18.740
 gap for them.

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:21.370
 So it gives them that extra nudge because

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:24.030
 they know by using Nuna, their care team

00:00:24.030 --> 00:00:24.340
 can

00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:26.400
 see inside of their health what they're

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:28.020
 doing outside of the visit.

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:30.330
 And that connection really helps empower

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:32.420
 them and lets them know that their care

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:33.100
 team cares

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:34.670
 for them and wants to see them improve

00:00:34.670 --> 00:00:35.460
 their health.

